,"right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"15ceddad","settings":{"editor":"<p>When it comes to keeping your home warm and comfortable during the winter, you need a heating system you can rely on. That\u2019s why homeowners across Hendersonville, Belle Meade, Cross Plains, East Nashville, Germantown, Goodlettsville, and other Middle Tennessee communities turn to Petitt Heating &amp; Cooling for trusted heating services.<\/p>"},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"7e4095eb","settings":{"editor":"<p><strong>Here\u2019s what sets us apart:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li><strong>Highly Trained Technicians:<\/strong>\u00a0Our team has completed specialized training to ensure we can handle any heating or furnace issue.<\/li><li><strong>Certified Professionals:<\/strong>\u00a0We are EPA and\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.cganet.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Compressed Gas-Certified<\/a>, meaning we meet the highest standards of safety and environmental care.<\/li><li><strong>Decades of Experience:<\/strong>\u00a0With over 50 years of combined industry experience, we have the knowledge and skills to provide top-quality repairs and maintenance.<\/li><li><strong>Licensed in Tennessee:<\/strong>\u00a0We hold a Mechanical License for Tennessee, ensuring our work is fully compliant with state regulations.<\/li><li><strong>Customer-Focused Service:<\/strong>\u00a0We believe in putting your needs first. Our goal is to treat your home with respect, offering personalized, reliable service every time.<\/li><\/ul><p><br \/>If your heating system needs repairs or maintenance, don\u2019t wait. Whether it\u2019s furnace repairs, routine maintenance, or a new installation, we\u2019re here to help Sumner County residents keep their homes warm and safe.<\/p>"},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"},{"id":"500d85d6","settings":{"content_widt