pe":"image","elType":"widget"},{"id":"514f5276","settings":{"text":"Call Now: (615) 654-0814","link":{"url":"tel:+16156540814","is_external":"","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":""},"selected_icon":{"value":"fas fa-phone-alt","library":"fa-solid"},"typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Montserrat","typography_font_size":{"unit":"em","size":1.2,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_size_tablet":{"unit":"em","size":"","sizes":[]},"typography_font_size_mobile":{"unit":"em","size":"","sizes":[]},"__globals__":{"hover_color":"globals\/colors?id=a23a917","background_color":"globals\/colors?id=secondary"},"hover_color":"#FFFFFF","align":"left","text_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"15","right":"25","bottom":"15","left":"25","isLinked":false}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"button","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"},{"id":"41fab8e5","settings":{"content_width":"full","flex_gap":{"column":"20","row":"20","isLinked":true,"unit":"px","size":20},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"4776d6b2","settings":{"title":"Comprehensive Annual Heating Services for Middle Tennessee Homes\n","__globals__":{"title_color":"globals\/colors?id=secondary"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"6b887e11","settings":{"editor":"<p>Keeping your heating system in top condition is essential for staying warm and comfortable during the cold Middle Tennessee winters. At Petitt Heating &amp; Cooling, our annual heating services are designed to ensure your furnace or heating system runs efficiently and reliably all season long. Here\u2019s what\u2019s included in our comprehensive service:<\/p>"},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"27e860c5","settings":{"editor":"<ul><li aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Thermostat checks and adjustments:<\/strong>\u00a0We ensure your thermostat is calibrated for optimal performance.<\/li><li aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Burner and control cleaning:<\/strong>\u00a0A clean burner means better efficiency and fewer breakdowns.<\/li><li aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Fan control and temperature rise checks:<\/strong>\u00a0We verify that your system is heating your home consistently and efficiently.<\/li><li aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Air filtration checks and recommendations:<\/strong>\u00a0Clean filters improve airflow and indoor air quality.<\/li><li aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Lubrication of moving parts:<\/strong>\u00a0Proper lubrication reduces wear and tear on your system.<\/li><li aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Complete furnace cycle inspection:<\/strong>\u00a0We make sure your system is operating smoothly from start to finish.<\/li><li aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Gas leak checks:<\/strong>\u00a0Safety is a priority, and we\u2019ll check for any potential leaks.<\/li><li aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Belt checks and tension adjustments:<\/strong>\u00a0Ensuring proper belt tension prevents breakdowns and keeps your system running efficiently.<\/li><li aria-level=\"1\">\u2026and more!<\/li><\/ul><p>We perform a thorough inspection to catch and fix any potential issues before they become costly problems. With our detailed service, you can rest easy knowing your heating system is ready to handle the coldest days in Hendersonville and surrounding areas.<\/p>"},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"}],"isInner":false,"elType":"container"},{"id":"2696f0cd","settings":{"flex_direction":"column","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"50","right":"0","bottom":"50","left":"0","isLinked":false},"_title":"PetittPromise-Services","background_background":"classic","__globals__":{"background_color":"globals\/colors?id=fd5335f"}},"elements":[{"id":"768f5571","settings":{"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"12dab6af","settings":{"title":"Why Your Neighbors Trust Petitt Heating & Coo